    "Configure a chave de %@ em Configurações → IA & Tradução para começar.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configure your %@ key in Settings → AI & Translation to get started."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configura la clave de %@ en Configuración → IA y traducción para empezar."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configurez votre clé %@ dans Réglages → IA et traduction pour commencer."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hinterlegen Sie Ihren %@-Schlüssel unter Einstellungen → KI & Übersetzung, um zu beginnen."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定 → AIと翻訳で%@のキーを設定してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在“设置 → AI 与翻译”中配置 %@ 密钥以开始使用。"}}}},
    "Não foi possível traduzir. Verifique a conexão e a configuração do provedor de IA.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not translate. Check your connection and AI provider settings."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo traducir. Revisa la conexión y la configuración del proveedor de IA."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La traduction a échoué. Vérifiez votre connexion et les réglages du fournisseur d’IA."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Übersetzung ist fehlgeschlagen. Prüfen Sie Ihre Verbindung und die Einstellungen des KI-Anbieters."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"翻訳できませんでした。接続とAIプロバイダーの設定を確認してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法翻译。请检查网络连接和 AI 提供商设置。"}}}},
    "Original salvo; tradução incompleta": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original saved; translation incomplete"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original guardado; traducción incompleta"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original enregistré ; traduction incomplète"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original gespeichert; Übersetzung unvollständig"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原文を保存しました。翻訳は未完了です"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原文已保存；翻译未完成"}}}},
