    "A escolha altera apenas esta biblioteca local. As versões preservadas continuam disponíveis para exportação.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The choice changes only this local library. Preserved versions remain available for export."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La elección solo modifica esta biblioteca local. Las versiones conservadas siguen disponibles para exportar."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ce choix modifie uniquement cette bibliothèque locale. Les versions conservées restent disponibles à l’exportation."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Die Auswahl ändert nur diese lokale Bibliothek. Aufbewahrte Versionen können weiterhin exportiert werden."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "この選択はこのローカルライブラリだけを変更します。保存されたバージョンは引き続き書き出せます。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此选择仅更改这个本地资料库。保留的版本仍可导出。"}}}},
    "Abrir ou criar": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Open or create"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abrir o crear"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ouvrir ou créer"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Öffnen oder erstellen"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "開く、または作成"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "打开或创建"}}}},
    "Alguns recursos precisam baixar modelos antes do primeiro uso.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Some features need to download models before first use."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Algunas funciones necesitan descargar modelos antes del primer uso."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Certaines fonctionnalités nécessitent le téléchargement de modèles avant la première utilisation."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Einige Funktionen müssen vor der ersten Nutzung Modelle herunterladen."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "一部の機能は、初回使用前にモデルのダウンロードが必要です。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "部分功能需要在首次使用前下载模型。"}}}},
    "As bibliotecas permanecem separadas. Aguarde a gravação, o processamento ou a edição terminar antes de trocar.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Libraries remain separate. Wait for recording, processing or editing to finish before switching."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Las bibliotecas permanecen separadas. Espera a que termine la grabación, el procesamiento o la edición antes de cambiar."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les bibliothèques restent séparées. Attendez la fin de l’enregistrement, du traitement ou de la modification avant de changer."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Die Bibliotheken bleiben getrennt. Warte vor dem Wechsel, bis Aufnahme, Verarbeitung oder Bearbeitung abgeschlossen sind."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ライブラリは個別に保持されます。録音、処理、編集が完了してから切り替えてください。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "各资料库保持独立。请等待录音、处理或编辑完成后再切换。"}}}},
    "Biblioteca de conta anterior": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Previous account library"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Biblioteca de una cuenta anterior"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothèque d’un ancien compte"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothek eines früheren Kontos"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "以前のアカウントのライブラリ"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "旧账户资料库"}}}},
    "Biblioteca local": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Local library"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Biblioteca local"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothèque locale"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lokale Bibliothek"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ローカルライブラリ"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "本地资料库"}}}},
    "Biblioteca local independente": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Independent local library"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Biblioteca local independiente"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothèque locale indépendante"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Unabhängige lokale Bibliothek"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "独立したローカルライブラリ"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "独立的本地资料库"}}}},
    "Bibliotecas neste Mac": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Libraries on this Mac"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliotecas en este Mac"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothèques sur ce Mac"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliotheken auf diesem Mac"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このMacのライブラリ"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此 Mac 上的资料库"}}}},
    "Configure um provedor com sua própria chave ou um serviço local. Provedores externos podem exigir internet e cobrar pelo uso.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Set up a provider with your own key or a local service. External providers may require internet and charge for usage."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Configura un proveedor con tu propia clave o un servicio local. Los proveedores externos pueden requerir internet y cobrar por el uso."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Configurez un fournisseur avec votre propre clé ou un service local. Les fournisseurs externes peuvent nécessiter internet et facturer l’utilisation."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Richte einen Anbieter mit deinem eigenen Schlüssel oder einen lokalen Dienst ein. Externe Anbieter können Internet erfordern und Nutzungsgebühren berechnen."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "自分のキーでプロバイダーを設定するか、ローカルサービスを設定してください。外部プロバイダーはインターネット接続が必要で、利用料金が発生する場合があります。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用自己的密钥配置提供商，或配置本地服务。外部提供商可能需要联网并收取使用费用。"}}}},
    "Ele será removido desta biblioteca local. Os áudios deste Mac não são afetados.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "It will be removed from this local library. Audio on this Mac is not affected."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se eliminará de esta biblioteca local. Los audios de este Mac no se verán afectados."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Il sera supprimé de cette bibliothèque locale. Les fichiers audio de ce Mac ne sont pas affectés."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Der Text wird aus dieser lokalen Bibliothek entfernt. Audiodateien auf diesem Mac bleiben unverändert."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このローカルライブラリから削除されます。このMacの音声ファイルには影響しません。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "它将从此本地资料库中移除。此 Mac 上的音频不受影响。"}}}},
    "Em uso": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "In use"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En uso"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En cours d’utilisation"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "In Verwendung"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用中"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在使用"}}}},
    "Esta biblioteca contém o que já foi baixado de uma conta anterior. Conteúdo que só existe na nuvem deve ser exportado pelo app anterior antes do encerramento do serviço. Áudios e versões locais permanecem neste Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This library contains content already downloaded from a previous account. Cloud-only content must be exported using the previous app before the service shuts down. Audio and local versions remain on this Mac."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta biblioteca contiene lo que ya se descargó de una cuenta anterior. El contenido que solo existe en la nube debe exportarse con la app anterior antes del cierre del servicio. Los audios y las versiones locales permanecen en este Mac."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cette bibliothèque contient les données déjà téléchargées d’un ancien compte. Le contenu présent uniquement dans le cloud doit être exporté avec l’ancienne app avant l’arrêt du service. Les fichiers audio et les versions locales restent sur ce Mac."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Diese Bibliothek enthält bereits heruntergeladene Inhalte eines früheren Kontos. Inhalte, die nur in der Cloud liegen, müssen vor der Abschaltung des Dienstes mit der bisherigen App exportiert werden. Audio und lokale Versionen bleiben auf diesem Mac."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このライブラリには、以前のアカウントからダウンロード済みの内容が含まれています。クラウドにしかない内容は、サービス終了前に以前のアプリで書き出してください。音声とローカルのバージョンはこのMacに残ります。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此资料库包含已从旧账户下载的内容。仅存在于云端的内容必须在服务关闭前通过旧版应用导出。音频和本地版本会保留在此 Mac 上。"}}}},
    "Este perfil fica somente neste Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This profile stays only on this Mac."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este perfil se guarda solo en este Mac."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ce profil reste uniquement sur ce Mac."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dieses Profil bleibt nur auf diesem Mac."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このプロフィールはこのMacにのみ保存されます。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此个人资料仅保存在这台 Mac 上。"}}}},
    "Exportar textos disponíveis neste Mac": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Export text available on this Mac"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Exportar textos disponibles en este Mac"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Exporter les textes disponibles sur ce Mac"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Auf diesem Mac verfügbare Texte exportieren"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このMacにあるテキストを書き出す"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "导出此 Mac 上可用的文本"}}}},
    "Grave, transcreva e organize sem uma conta Voiz.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Record, transcribe and organize without a Voiz account."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Graba, transcribe y organiza sin una cuenta Voiz."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enregistrez, transcrivez et organisez sans compte Voiz."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aufnehmen, transkribieren und organisieren ohne Voiz-Konto."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Voizアカウントなしで録音、文字起こし、整理ができます。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无需 Voiz 账户即可录音、转录和整理。"}}}},
    "Modelos de transcrição": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Transcription models"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Modelos de transcripción"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Modèles de transcription"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Transkriptionsmodelle"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "文字起こしモデル"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "转录模型"}}}},
    "Não foi possível abrir a biblioteca local. Seus arquivos foram preservados.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Could not open the local library. Your files have been preserved."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo abrir la biblioteca local. Tus archivos se han conservado."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Impossible d’ouvrir la bibliothèque locale. Vos fichiers ont été conservés."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Die lokale Bibliothek konnte nicht geöffnet werden. Deine Dateien wurden aufbewahrt."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ローカルライブラリを開けませんでした。ファイルは保持されています。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法打开本地资料库。你的文件已保留。"}}}},
    "Não foi possível concluir a exportação. Os arquivos originais foram preservados.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Could not complete the export. The original files have been preserved."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo completar la exportación. Los archivos originales se han conservado."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Impossible de terminer l’exportation. Les fichiers originaux ont été conservés."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Der Export konnte nicht abgeschlossen werden. Die Originaldateien wurden aufbewahrt."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "書き出しを完了できませんでした。元のファイルは保持されています。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法完成导出。原始文件已保留。"}}}},
    "Não foi possível iniciar a operação nesta biblioteca. Confira a biblioteca no Perfil.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Could not start the operation in this library. Check the library in Profile."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo iniciar la operación en esta biblioteca. Revisa la biblioteca en Perfil."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Impossible de démarrer l’opération dans cette bibliothèque. Vérifiez-la dans Profil."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Der Vorgang konnte in dieser Bibliothek nicht gestartet werden. Prüfe die Bibliothek im Profil."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このライブラリで操作を開始できませんでした。プロフィールでライブラリを確認してください。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法在此资料库中开始操作。请在个人资料中检查资料库。"}}}},
    "Os textos na lixeira ficam disponíveis para consulta e restauração neste Mac.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text in the trash remains available to view and restore on this Mac."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los textos de la papelera siguen disponibles para consultar y restaurar en este Mac."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les textes dans la corbeille restent consultables et restaurables sur ce Mac."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Texte im Papierkorb können auf diesem Mac weiterhin angezeigt und wiederhergestellt werden."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ゴミ箱のテキストは、このMacで引き続き閲覧、復元できます。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "废纸篓中的文本仍可在此 Mac 上查看和恢复。"}}}},
    "Perfil e bibliotecas locais": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Profile and local libraries"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Perfil y bibliotecas locales"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Profil et bibliothèques locales"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Profil und lokale Bibliotheken"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "プロフィールとローカルライブラリ"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "个人资料和本地资料库"}}}},
    "Restaurar a preservada…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restore preserved version…"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restaurar la versión conservada…"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restaurer la version conservée…"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aufbewahrte Version wiederherstellen…"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "保存されたバージョンを復元…"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "恢复保留的版本…"}}}},
    "Restaurar a versão preservada": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restore the preserved version"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restaurar la versión conservada"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restaurer la version conservée"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aufbewahrte Version wiederherstellen"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "保存されたバージョンを復元"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "恢复保留的版本"}}}},
    "Seu trabalho, no seu Mac": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Your work, on your Mac"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu trabajo, en tu Mac"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Votre travail, sur votre Mac"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Deine Arbeit, auf deinem Mac"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "あなたの仕事を、あなたのMacで"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "你的工作，就在你的 Mac 上"}}}},
    "Sua escolha de IA": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Your choice of AI"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La IA que tú elijas"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "L’IA de votre choix"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KI nach deiner Wahl"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AIを自分で選択"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "自由选择 AI"}}}},
    "Suas reuniões, conversas e áudios ficam neste Mac. Mantenha uma cópia de segurança.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Your meetings, conversations and audio stay on this Mac. Keep a backup."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tus reuniones, conversaciones y audios se guardan en este Mac. Mantén una copia de seguridad."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vos réunions, conversations et fichiers audio restent sur ce Mac. Conservez une copie de sauvegarde."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Deine Besprechungen, Unterhaltungen und Audiodateien bleiben auf diesem Mac. Lege eine Sicherungskopie an."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "会議、会話、音声はこのMacに保存されます。バックアップを作成してください。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "你的会议、对话和音频保存在此 Mac 上。请保留备份。"}}}},
    "Texto da biblioteca": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Library text"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Texto de la biblioteca"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Texte de la bibliothèque"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothekstext"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ライブラリのテキスト"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "资料库文本"}}}},
    "Textos exportados: %lld": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Texts exported: %lld"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Textos exportados: %lld"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Textes exportés : %lld"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Exportierte Texte: %lld"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "書き出したテキスト数：%lld"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已导出的文本数：%lld"}}}},
    "Usando a biblioteca local": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Using the local library"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usando la biblioteca local"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bibliothèque locale en cours d’utilisation"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lokale Bibliothek wird verwendet"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ローカルライブラリを使用中"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在使用本地资料库"}}}},
    "Usando os dados já baixados desta biblioteca. Itens somente na nuvem não estão incluídos.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Using data already downloaded to this library. Cloud-only items are not included."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se usan los datos ya descargados de esta biblioteca. No se incluyen los elementos que solo están en la nube."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utilisation des données déjà téléchargées de cette bibliothèque. Les éléments présents uniquement dans le cloud ne sont pas inclus."}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bereits heruntergeladene Daten dieser Bibliothek werden verwendet. Inhalte, die nur in der Cloud liegen, sind nicht enthalten."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "このライブラリにダウンロード済みのデータを使用しています。クラウドにしかない項目は含まれていません。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在使用此资料库中已下载的数据。不包含仅存在于云端的项目。"}}}},
    "Usar a atual…": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Use current version…"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usar la versión actual…"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utiliser la version actuelle…"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aktuelle Version verwenden…"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "現在のバージョンを使用…"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用当前版本…"}}}},
    "Usar a versão atual": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Use the current version"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usar la versión actual"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Utiliser la version actuelle"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aktuelle Version verwenden"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "現在のバージョンを使用"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用当前版本"}}}},
    "Versão atual": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Current version"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Versión actual"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Version actuelle"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aktuelle Version"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "現在のバージョン"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "当前版本"}}}},
    "Versão preservada": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Preserved version"}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Versión conservada"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Version conservée"}}, "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aufbewahrte Version"}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "保存されたバージョン"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "保留的版本"}}}}
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
